{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"content_hash":"9dcbd6e8f1491f1d9f0bd2b71c185c222da96dd72012ef00ea65e8f75c6fac52","digest":{"component_or_area":"BindingStore rich-emission facade","key_entities":["BindingStore.note_rich_emit","all_bindings()","apply_handlers._observe_rich_reemit","BindingStore.save()","state/test_rich_reemit_state.py","test_narrow_operation_matches_the_legacy_counter_progression","test_narrow_operation_persists_the_same_bytes_as_the_legacy_sequence","test_the_operation_performs_no_save_at_either_layer","test_a_missing_binding_is_nonfatal_and_distinguishable","test_all_bindings_copy_depth_is_unchanged_by_the_new_seam","test_the_narrow_operation_does_not_expose_the_owners"],"problem_keywords":["rich-text convergence","binding mutation","lifecycle policy","shallow query","facade operation","counter progression","hash equivalence","persisted bytes","missing binding"],"propositions":["A narrow BindingStore mutation operation must produce identical hash, counter, and persisted bytes as the legacy shallow all_bindings mutation sequence for changed, unchanged, and missing binding cases.","The operation must not perform any save call on any code path (changed, unchanged, or missing binding), matching the production caller which mutates in place and relies on the pass's later unconditional save.","Missing bindings must remain nonfatal and distinguishable, returning a distinct result from the counter integer.","all_bindings() must remain shallow (outer mapping fresh per call, inner entries shared) and all existing facade signatures must remain unchanged.","No production adapter must receive direct writable repository or lifecycle objects through the new mutation seam."]},"digest_hash_version":1,"model":"bedrock:us.an